	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You gain immunity to both the [[/condition id=charmed]] and [[/condition id=frightened]] conditions.</p><p><strong>Active Effect: </strong><em><strong>Ominous Glower.</strong></em> As your action, you choose one creature within 60ft and channel your Aspect in your gaze. The target must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Spell DC (or Maneuver DC if you can’t cast spells), or take 3d8 necrotic damage and become Frightened of you until the end of their next turn.</p><p>On a success, the target takes half damage and isn’t Frightened.</p>",
